cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Sorbed in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Sorbed: explainable pressure-injury image analysis and grading"
abstract: >-
  Sorbed is open-source clinical decision-support software that analyzes
  photographs of pressure injuries (bedsores) and produces an explainable,
  provisional grade with a ranked evidence trace, tissue composition, and
  calibrated morphometrics. It is not a medical device and does not diagnose.
type: software
